Register the d457-sipl Holoscan code with HSB 2.7.0 (applied by tools/prepare_hsb.sh d457 after it
copies d457-sipl/hsb/{src,python,examples} into the tree): the d457_sipl_capture operator and its
Python binding in the SIPL block, D457SIPLCaptureOp in the operator registry, and the two D457
Python examples. Unlike HSB 2.5.0, upstream's sipl_capture builds on L4T R39.2 in 2.7.0, so it is
left enabled.

diff --git a/examples/CMakeLists.txt b/examples/CMakeLists.txt
index 6ebece5..c726749 100644
--- a/examples/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/examples/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -796,6 +796,8 @@ if(HOLOLINK_BUILD_FUSA)
 endif() # HOLOLINK_BUILD_FUSA
 if(HOLOLINK_BUILD_SIPL)
   list(APPEND EXAMPLE_INSTALL_FILES sipl_player.py)
+  list(APPEND EXAMPLE_INSTALL_FILES d457_sipl_player.py)
+  list(APPEND EXAMPLE_INSTALL_FILES d457_tao_peoplenet.py)
 endif() # HOLOLINK_BUILD_SIPL
 endif() # HOLOLINK_BUILD_PYTHON
 
